  <body>
    <epigraph>
      <p>献给所有在夜里读书的人。</p>
      <text-author>无名氏</text-author>
    </epigraph>
    <section>
      <title>
        <p>第一章 出发</p>
      </title>
      <p>天亮之前，码头还笼在雾里。The dock was still wrapped in fog before dawn.</p>
      <empty-line/>
      <p>老周把最后一只箱子搬上船，低声说：“走吧。”</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>
        <p>第二章 星图</p>
        <p>The Star Chart</p>
      </title>
      <epigraph>
        <p>“All roads lead to the sea.”</p>
      </epigraph>
      <p>船身在浪里轻轻摇晃，他把星图摊在膝上。He spread the star chart on his knees.</p>
      <poem>
        <stanza>
          <v>星光落在旧木桌上</v>
          <v>Starlight falls on the old wooden desk</v>
        </stanza>
      </poem>
      <empty-line/>
      <p>“往北。”他说。</p>
      <section>
        <title>
          <p>二·一 暗礁</p>
        </title>
        <p>暗礁像一排黑色的牙齿。The reef looked like a row of black teeth.</p>
      </section>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>
        <p>第三章 归航</p>
      </title>
      <p>很多年以后，他仍然记得那晚的灯。Many years later, he still remembered the light of that night.</p>
      <empty-line/>
      <p>书到此为止。This is the end.</p>
    </section>
  </body>
